{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/961350-mages-and-resurection","id":961350,"title":"Mages and Resurection","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-31T19:16:33-07:00","id":961350,"title":"Mages and Resurection","content":"Alright I have chatting with the group I play with and there seems to be some disagreement on whether a mage can bring someone back from the dead. So I am asking everyone here is it possible to create a Mage who is able to bring someone back from the dead &amp; what kind of skill would they need? Yes I know this would be some hi level magic but would like to here some feedback either way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12294-haloth","name":"Haloth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12294_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T19:32:46-07:00","id":961359,"title":"","content":"Unmaking Death allows it. Spirit Mages can cheat by transforming a proper rank spirit into a spirit of life and gifting it a ressurection spirit power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-31T23:20:05-07:00","id":961474,"title":"","content":"Deny the Reaper is a 5 dot Death spell that can resurrect people with a Reach, but it's not Lasting, and they have to have only died recently.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1692-maina","name":"Maina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1692_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"724"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T05:54:28-07:00","id":961610,"title":"","content":"You can also use mythical <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/668690-mystery-supernal-alchemy-philosopher-s-stone\">Philosopher's Stone</a> to this... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T11:49:24-07:00","id":961803,"title":"","content":"Note: Souls sold separately. Make sure you have theirs, or a replacement, handy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-03T03:18:57-07:00","id":962748,"title":"","content":"Aside from the Death example: prior to errate you could do it with Time 3 but that's not the case anymore. Though I think Time 5 Unmaking should be still able to do it.<br /> <br /> A Life 5 Making spell could resurrect the body, but it wouldn't bring the personality. Perhaps with Mind 5 conjuctional but not sure.<br /> <br /> Ah magic, so many ways to go around a thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2636-menace","name":"Menace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2636_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"527"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-03T12:11:33-07:00","id":962938,"title":"","content":"Easily done with Mastery in one way or another.<br /> You might be able to get away with resuscitation through a Forces defibrillator spell, too.<br /> Assuming you get to them before brain death and they havent lost any of the neccesary parts for living...<br /> <br /> For the Master-level resurrections though...<br /> If their resurrected existence is hanging simply by a magical thread,<br /> and they're seeking to keep it going, does that make them liches for cheating death?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11641-yelesom","name":"Yelesom","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11641_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-03T12:33:43-07:00","id":962945,"title":"","content":"Some might try to argue it, but you could argue the other way too, the resurrected isn't trying to cheat his natural lifespan just having the damage of an unfortunate incident undone which may have been avoidable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}